      "note": "Root cause fixed by commit `608e9e9a4ec4d2013faf1b8f9ecec09e90f131f2`. Vulnerable code keeps `orig_x` as a raw alias to the current `pdf_xref_entry` across the `pdf_load_obj_stm` call even though that helper can solidify and relocate the xref; the patch re-fetches the entry after the helper instead of reusing this stale pointer.",
